# A tiny to-do model: typed list, methods, iteration.
Let tasks be [] as list of text.

Define function add taking t as text:
    tasks's append(t).
End.

Define function report giving nothing:
    For each t in tasks:
        Show t.
    End.
End.

call add with "write the parser".
call add with "add a type system".
call add with "ship it".
Show "todo list:".
call report.
Show "count:".
Show len(tasks).
